  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ha Noi Rethink</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will support Ha Noi City in a new strategic visioning exercise and pilot the implementation of this vision of a Creative City of Design, following the recent designation by UNESCO. This project will be catalytic in developing a narrative that can link disjointed local initiatives into a coherent whole, and create new development opportunities as well as driving inclusive and sustainable growth. The active participation of the youth will also be vital to realize this ambitious vision. This project will mobilize cultural dynamics and their participation to contribute to the strategic vision of Ha Noi as the Creative Capital of Viet Nam.</narrative>
  </description>
